{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe rain has drowned the illuminations for the Emperor’s name day, but the house at the Italian opera was thick as a crowd. Twenty-nine voices, including Fodor and Rubini, sang the anthem in unison. It was loud, certainly, though I confess the German premiere of the Auber work that followed was a trifle stiff. I met a friend who insists the food in the foyer is inferior to our Berlin dining, a claim I am not yet prepared to concede.\n\nI have sent my luggage on ahead. It is strange to be so light; one feels less anchored, perhaps more like a thought in motion rather than a substance. I hope Karl is managing his studies with the requisite discipline, and not letting his imagination wander too far ahead of his logic. I shall write again from Prague.\n\nYour loving\nHegel"}}],"created":1795219334,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":177,"prompt_tokens":1124,"total_tokens":1301,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-JtJScY4RFfacmmM24jXTUQ1xsT1U0Ytq","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1124,"prompt_ms":1169.215,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.040226868327402,"prompt_per_second":961.3287547628111,"predicted_n":177,"predicted_ms":4196.851,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.845744318181815,"predicted_per_second":41.93620407300617}}